      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.30 (down from ₹35.63 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹884.3m (up 9.0% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹513.7m (down 80% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 58% (down from 309% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 17% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 19% per year.",
